  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 200C, fan-forced. Line a large oven tray with baking paper. Thinly slice the capsicum and onion. Drain the pineapple pieces.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1297036/photos/large/182405_1-a24db65808ab741b72f65f08ae48ed56.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep toppings: Put the barbecue seasoning and 1 tsp olive oil in a large bowl, season with salt and pepper and stir to combine. Add the capsicum, onion and pineapple and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1297037/photos/large/182405_2-39623f80af84ded1fa36f55670d5556e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep pizza bases: Put 2 pita on the lined tray. Spread 2 tbs barbecue sauce over the pita.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1297038/photos/large/182405_3-832f06385b3b6d2b38a7a6dcf82ed37e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add toppings: Scatter the spinach (see Make it yours) and pineapple mixture over the pizza bases. Crumble the feta over the top. Bake the pizzas for 10-12 mins until golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1297039/photos/large/182405_4-397374cba2f4cdf49ab7b4e802423d74.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Meanwhile, combine 2 tbs mayonnaise and 1 tsp water in a bowl. Drizzle the mayo mixture over the pizzas, cut into wedges and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1297040/photos/large/182405_5-9359f7a82d2e335b27d9415a2d7b3cb1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Fancy a side salad? Reserve half the spinach and dress with a quick vinaigrette. This could be as simple as olive oil and your favourite vinegar, or add some honey, mustard or crushed garlic for an easy flavour boost.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1297041/photos/large/182405_6-3fc7e4bc10b9f60089bb22d06b61120d.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
